<a style=3D"position:relative;top:-38px;" name=3D"544eb4250eacd956"></a>
<!--heading--><h2 class=3D"chap"><img title=3D"Back to top" src=3D"https://=
plantuml.com/backtop1.svg" width=3D"20" height=3D"20" class=3D"backtop"><di=
v class=3D"dropdown"><button class=3D"dropbtn"><img width=3D"16" height=3D"=
16" src=3D"https://plantuml.com/edit1.svg"></button><div class=3D"dropdown-=
content"><a href=3D"http://alphadoc.plantuml.com/cmp/dokuwiki/es/index#1"><=
img width=3D"20" height=3D"20" src=3D"https://plantuml.com/dokuwiki.png">Ed=
it in Dokuwiki</a><a href=3D"http://alphadoc.plantuml.com/cmp/asciidoc/es/i=
ndex#1"><img width=3D"20" height=3D"20" src=3D"https://plantuml.com/asciido=
c32.png">Edit in Asciidoc</a><a href=3D"http://alphadoc.plantuml.com/cmp/ma=
rkdown/es/index#1"><img width=3D"20" height=3D"20" src=3D"https://plantuml.=
com/markdown.png">Edit in Markdown</a></div></div>=F0=9F=9A=80 Primeros pas=
os</h2>
<p></p>
<strong>PlantUML</strong> es una herramienta muy vers=C3=A1til que facilita=
 la creaci=C3=B3n r=C3=A1pida y directa de una amplia gama de diagramas.
<p></p>
Utilizando un lenguaje sencillo e intuitivo, los usuarios pueden redactar s=
in esfuerzo diversos tipos de diagramas.
Para una exploraci=C3=B3n detallada de las capacidades del lenguaje y la si=
ntaxis, por favor consulte la <a href=3D"https://plantuml.com/es/guide">Gu=
=C3=ADa de Referencia del Lenguaje PlantUML</a>.
<p></p>
Si usted es nuevo en PlantUML, le recomendamos que comience con nuestra <a =
href=3D"https://plantuml.com/es/starting">p=C3=A1gina de inicio r=C3=A1pido=
</a> para ponerse en marcha
r=C3=A1pidamente. Si tiene alguna pregunta, nuestra <a href=3D"https://plan=
tuml.com/es/faq">p=C3=A1gina F.A.Q.</a> es un recurso valioso.
Adem=C3=A1s, PlantUML se puede integrar perfectamente con <a href=3D"https:=
//plantuml.com/es/running">una variedad de otras herramientas</a> para mejo=
rar su flujo de trabajo.
<a style=3D"position:relative;top:-38px;" name=3D"2a2b6e53c5a4c591"></a>
<!--heading--><h2 class=3D"chap"><img title=3D"Back to top" src=3D"https://=
plantuml.com/backtop1.svg" width=3D"20" height=3D"20" class=3D"backtop"><di=
v class=3D"dropdown"><button class=3D"dropbtn"><img width=3D"16" height=3D"=
16" src=3D"https://plantuml.com/edit1.svg"></button><div class=3D"dropdown-=
content"><a href=3D"http://alphadoc.plantuml.com/cmp/dokuwiki/es/index#2"><=
img width=3D"20" height=3D"20" src=3D"https://plantuml.com/dokuwiki.png">Ed=
it in Dokuwiki</a><a href=3D"http://alphadoc.plantuml.com/cmp/asciidoc/es/i=
ndex#2"><img width=3D"20" height=3D"20" src=3D"https://plantuml.com/asciido=
c32.png">Edit in Asciidoc</a><a href=3D"http://alphadoc.plantuml.com/cmp/ma=
rkdown/es/index#2"><img width=3D"20" height=3D"20" src=3D"https://plantuml.=
com/markdown.png">Edit in Markdown</a></div></div>=F0=9F=A7=A9 Diagramas UM=
L soportados</h2>
<p></p>
Con PlantUML, puede crear diagramas UML bien estructurados, incluyendo pero=
 no limitado a:
<p></p>
<ul>
<li><a href=3D"https://plantuml.com/es/sequence-diagram">Diagrama de secuen=
cia</a></li>
<li><a href=3D"https://plantuml.com/es/use-case-diagram">Diagrama de casos =
de uso</a></li>
<li><a href=3D"https://plantuml.com/es/class-diagram">Diagrama de clases</a=
></li>
<li><a href=3D"https://plantuml.com/es/object-diagram">Diagrama de objetos<=
/a></li>
<li><a href=3D"https://plantuml.com/es/activity-diagram-beta">Diagrama de a=
ctividades</a> <em>(Encuentre <a href=3D"https://plantuml.com/es/activity-d=
iagram-legacy">aqu=C3=AD</a> la <a href=3D"https://plantuml.com/es/activity=
-diagram-legacy">sintaxis heredada</a>)</em></li>
<li><a href=3D"https://plantuml.com/es/component-diagram">Diagrama de compo=
nentes</a></li>
<li><a href=3D"https://plantuml.com/es/deployment-diagram">Diagrama de desp=
liegue</a></li>
<li><a href=3D"https://plantuml.com/es/state-diagram">Diagrama de estado</a=
></li>
<li><a href=3D"https://plantuml.com/es/timing-diagram">Diagrama temporal</a=
></li>
</ul>
<a style=3D"position:relative;top:-38px;" name=3D"6255d7ba3ee1e2ec"></a>
<!--heading--><h2 class=3D"chap"><img title=3D"Back to top" src=3D"https://=
